{"time": 1749737530, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "放下酒杯，往酒吧前台走"}
{"time": 1749737571, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（吧台？"}
{"time": 1749737582, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“客人还需要什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1749737596, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天怎么没人在唱歌?\""}
{"time": 1749737689, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“今天暂时没有演出，不过明后两天都有乐队拼盘演出，叫做“召唤”，你们可以那是再来哦”"}
{"time": 1749737706, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"召唤?\""}
{"time": 1749737721, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"summon，有点意思，说什么的?\""}
{"time": 1749737722, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我看这儿的装潢和重金属好像没那么匹配”"}
{"time": 1749737798, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们酒吧只是摇滚livehouse，并不是专注于重金属的”"}
{"time": 1749737816, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那你说说，摇滚和召唤有什么联系，有奖励哦。\""}
{"time": 1749737832, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“召唤这个名字只是我瞎想的，我觉得很酷”"}
{"time": 1749737850, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你想的？你也要参加表演吗？”"}
{"time": 1749737903, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样，那真可惜，没有奖励了。这里最好的酒是什么\""}
{"time": 1749737925, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我是老板啊，我和那几个乐队商量的”"}
{"time": 1749738016, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“老板你还亲自上阵吧台啊，这倒是少见。”"}
{"time": 1749738027, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们这里最好的酒是莫吉托和龙舌兰”"}
{"time": 1749738056, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我自己会调酒嘛，所以还能剩一个员工的工资”"}
{"time": 1749738056, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“果汁”*一饮而尽，给出评价"}
{"time": 1749738057, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还行，我想去后台看看，不如把这两种酒都点几轮?\""}
{"time": 1749738095, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这......来后台看是想干什么？”"}
{"time": 1749738242, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看看嘛?不行\""}
{"time": 1749738300, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“毕竟这很奇怪不是吗？突然要看看后台什么的”"}
{"time": 1749738357, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我对乐队什么的很感兴趣，你们说是吧\""}
{"time": 1749738411, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这位小姐为了追星花过不少钱”*耸肩“我不建议你真的放她进去，说不定会放录音笔呢”"}
{"time": 1749738435, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是我想摇滚乐队应该挺欢迎自己被报上花边新闻”"}
{"time": 1749738500, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“喜欢看乐队演出就明天来看吧，或者你们想喝酒，也可以喝个够”"}
{"time": 1749738533, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要门票吗？”"}
{"time": 1749738592, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“到时候会在门口售票，你们准时来便是”"}
{"time": 1749738768, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"倒是不错。\""}
{"time": 1749738791, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过我进去转一圈，给你这里今晚的消费包了，可是稳赚不赔的买卖\""}
{"time": 1749738795, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你给他控了算了.jpg）"}
