{"time": 1750255387, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "文关精神病院原本是一家公立精神病院，后来因经营不善，被私人收购，要求是需要承担一定的社会职能，也就是说需要接收一些特殊的精神病人，而邓可心就是其中之一。"}
{"time": 1750255401, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一般来说，探望病人需要身份的吧”"}
{"time": 1750255422, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "同时因为其私立性质，这里的病房基本都是单人间"}
{"time": 1750255432, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "条件非常的好"}
{"time": 1750255437, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这就不用担心了，我可以伪造邓可欣的家人身份证。”"}
{"time": 1750255454, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。st show伪造"}
{"time": 1750255454, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月神夜]的[伪造]: 80"}
{"time": 1750255498, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊？\""}
{"time": 1750255498, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "顾幼龄来到前台，有一个四十多岁的大妈在接待，她问你是要来探望还是要治疗"}
{"time": 1750255498, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，那倒是很方便了”"}
{"time": 1750255500, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有这个必要吗\""}
{"time": 1750255598, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"来探望\""}
{"time": 1750255600, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可以吗？\""}
{"time": 1750255658, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“请问你是要探望哪一个病人呢?”"}
{"time": 1750255686, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"邓可心?是叫这个名字吗？\""}
{"time": 1750255783, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就是她”"}
{"time": 1750255862, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好的，请问各位是她的什么人？”"}
