{"time": 1750256765, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月神夜]进行技能[侦查:80]检定: 1D100=17 困难成功，且将新火试新茶，诗酒趁年华"}
{"time": 1750256806, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "肖越和还有月神夜发现这个医生面色比较的红润，仿佛刚经历什么很开心的事"}
{"time": 1750256827, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他注意到你们后警惕地开口“你们是谁？”"}
{"time": 1750256864, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我们是邓可欣的亲戚，来探望她的。”"}
{"time": 1750256880, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这是她的病房吧？”"}
{"time": 1750256909, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“是的，你们要探望她就进去吧，不要太久”"}
{"time": 1750256955, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好的，她最近怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1750256995, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打量这个医生一会"}
{"time": 1750256997, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“挺好的，没啥问题”"}
{"time": 1750257123, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“居然这么安分？我还以为她会整点动静出来”"}
{"time": 1750257140, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=870116719][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 一个普普通通的医生，穿着白大褂，手上拿着笔记本，衣服有些乱"}
{"time": 1750257166, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低着头，准备进去\n"}
{"time": 1750257173, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“怎么会呢，邓小姐是我们这里很听话的病人”"}
{"time": 1750257214, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“医生，你的肩膀上怎么有根长头发？”"}
{"time": 1750257289, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“诶？有吗？”他拍了拍肩头“可能什么时候弄到的吧”"}
{"time": 1750257330, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你们探望吧，我还有其他工作”说完他就离开了"}
{"time": 1750257341, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "进屋"}
{"time": 1750257473, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你们走进病房，里面大的不像是一个精神病人该住的房间，不仅是单人病房，还有电视和书架，桌子上摆着数种水果和一个花瓶，房间内甚至还有通往另一个房间的门"}
{"time": 1750257516, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "邓可心此时正躺在床上看电视，有一个护工在帮她削苹果，她们看到你们后愣了一下"}
{"time": 1750257616, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....\""}
{"time": 1750257654, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“过的还挺好啊，芽儿”"}
{"time": 1750257796, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "邓可心脸上闪过一瞬惊讶，不过她很快压制住了，并对护工说你们是她的亲戚，让她先出去一下"}
{"time": 1750257824, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "护工把削好的苹果递给她，然后离开了"}
{"time": 1750257874, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "见她离开，邓可心仿佛换了一个人，眼睛眯起来盯着你们"}
{"time": 1750257890, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“说吧，什么身份”"}
{"time": 1750257904, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"过得还不错?\""}
{"time": 1750257929, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "索性也懒得装了，抬起头看着她，\"这些年过得真不错\""}
{"time": 1750257949, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“是啊，我是过的还好”"}
{"time": 1750258005, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不过除了你们三个“亲戚”，也还没有人来探望过我呢”"}
{"time": 1750258071, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这也没办法嘛，毕竟这是到了鱼死网破的时候\""}
{"time": 1750258162, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哈？怎么回事？”"}
{"time": 1750258236, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你知道有人离开了家族这事吗？”"}
{"time": 1750258249, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"据族长说，现在是最后时刻了\""}
{"time": 1750258288, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“离开家族？谁离开了家族，这我还真不知道”"}
{"time": 1750258311, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“有三个人离开了家族。”"}
{"time": 1750258361, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "（月神夜是？）"}
{"time": 1750258384, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“......难道说，五年前？”"}
{"time": 1750258732, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“差不多那时候”"}
{"time": 1750258750, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有三个人叛离了，还带了重要的东西走”"}
{"time": 1750258800, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以说现在需要我喽”"}
{"time": 1750258837, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你们打算怎么做？”"}
{"time": 1750258864, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不知道\""}
{"time": 1750258876, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这里部分的医生和护工都和我关系很好，但是你知道的，这很难”"}
{"time": 1750258990, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，社会关系可不可以。\""}
{"time": 1750259187, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“也许不行，虽然我可以外出，但是得给好处给院方，而且会有人陪同”"}
{"time": 1750259247, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“直接找关系离开的话，可能会惊扰到很多人”"}
{"time": 1750259318, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这边的监控时不时会坏掉，我和一些医护人员关系很好，剩下的你们看看怎么做吧”"}
{"time": 1750259418, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“时不时会坏掉是什么意思？”"}
{"time": 1750259448, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“……”她露出一副这人怎么这么蠢的表情"}
{"time": 1750259505, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我是问你坏掉的时间。”"}
{"time": 1750259531, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这些信息难道还要我们自己去找？你在这里这么多年白呆了？”"}
{"time": 1750259583, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....好啦好啦，都是同事是不是\""}
{"time": 1750259643, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我说我开心它就会坏，你听懂了吗”"}
{"time": 1750259969, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "耸耸肩，\"你是在这里住惯了\""}
{"time": 1750259980, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不想出去的话，也无妨吧\""}
{"time": 1750260017, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我是无所谓，反正我过得很舒服”"}
{"time": 1750260025, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "她也摆摆手"}
{"time": 1750260264, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了，你们两位的意见呢？\""}
{"time": 1750260351, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我觉得人手还是不够，那三个家伙的社会地位比较难搞。”"}
{"time": 1750260376, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过，有个问题是，现在这个情况，你能做什么。\"一只手戳着自己的脸颊，颇具可爱的样子，装作无辜看着她"}
{"time": 1750260394, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也不是多一个人就能解决的事，不如说，我觉得，你应该有不出去也能帮上我们的办法吧”"}
{"time": 1750260478, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我在病院怎么帮你们呢？再怎么说我也只是一个病人”"}
{"time": 1750260521, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你们要找他们麻烦，直接找机会把他们做了就是，什么时候要担心这么多了”"}
{"time": 1750260562, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看见没，这就是老一辈的文化自信\""}
{"time": 1750260578, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过，我还是好奇你能做什么，我是指出去的话\""}
{"time": 1750260694, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1052896677][CQ:at,qq=2468514664] “毕竟不小心就会被送进精神病院”"}
{"time": 1750260786, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我可是当年四个人其中之一，自然有我的手段”她对你们眨眨眼，露出妩媚的神态"}
{"time": 1750260802, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": ".rh魅惑70"}
{"time": 1750260802, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[白勺确]试图在黑暗中窥见岁月史书"}
{"time": 1750260803, "type": "reply_private", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[白勺确]演奏出: {魅惑}70=1570"}
{"time": 1750260842, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看看效果)"}
{"time": 1750260901, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "眼前这人让你们感觉非常的亲切，不由自主地就想要听她的话，想要让她对自己做这样那样的事"}
{"time": 1750260970, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1081119000][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “当年那是被偷袭了”"}
{"time": 1750261055, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...论魅惑的本事，我也不差。\""}
{"time": 1750261060, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。st show取悦"}
{"time": 1750261060, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]的[取悦]: 70"}
{"time": 1750261109, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra取悦"}
{"time": 1750261109, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]进行技能[取悦:70]检定: 1D100=93 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1750261141, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "她笑得花枝乱颤“小妹妹还差点火候”"}
{"time": 1750261163, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看上去你这边倒是很容易出去，你知道另一边那个谁的情况吗？\"装作不在意，眨眨眼问"}
{"time": 1750261267, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？原来还有人吗，我还以为另外三个都走了呢”"}
{"time": 1750261290, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（都死了，唉差不多这意思）"}
{"time": 1750261424, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还剩一个，没品味，喜欢啃腐肉的秃鹫\""}
{"time": 1750261466, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你应该认识\""}
{"time": 1750261536, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那家伙挺厉害的，确实得找他。他和我一样吗？”"}
{"time": 1750261575, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“估计大差不差吧，不过想来没你混得好”"}
{"time": 1750261717, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这样吧，晚上监控也许会坏，你们看看怎么办”"}
{"time": 1750261742, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“总之我不可能自己走出去”"}
{"time": 1750261813, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难道要我背你吗\""}
{"time": 1750261864, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你可以背我飞出去”"}
{"time": 1750261897, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我可不是什么童话里的魔女\""}
{"time": 1750261913, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你们可以过一个灵感"}
{"time": 1750261921, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra灵感"}
{"time": 1750261921, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]进行技能[灵感:75]检定: 1D100=64 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1750261953, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。ra灵感"}
{"time": 1750261953, "type": "reply", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[肖越和]进行技能[灵感:80]检定: 1D100=59 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1750261966, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你想起来，你们确实从祭司手中得到了一个能飞的东西"}
{"time": 1750261973, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦np）"}
{"time": 1750262041, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“宝，我要出去只能靠你们啊”"}
{"time": 1750262080, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...那东西真的可以这么用吗....\""}
{"time": 1750262163, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“什么东西？”"}
{"time": 1750262262, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿出哨子，\"唉，你想坐扫帚吗？\""}
{"time": 1750262301, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你确定要现在走？"}
{"time": 1750262313, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（大白天坐着拜亚基飞出去？"}
{"time": 1750262329, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉这东西不管什么时候出现都很麻烦\""}
{"time": 1750262385, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "她看着哨子，似乎明白了什么“趁着夜色的话，就能降低风险了”"}
{"time": 1750262532, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……是否有些太离经叛道了”"}
{"time": 1750262646, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那个是拿来偷渡的吗？被发现怎么办”"}
{"time": 1750262716, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你们也可以想想有什么降低逃出去影响的方法）"}
{"time": 1750262728, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不用拜亚基的话）"}
{"time": 1750262732, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“被发现就解决目击证人，我相信这东西能很好的进行工作。”"}
{"time": 1750262762, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“还是说你也想帮着解决目击证人？”\n*看向肖越和"}
{"time": 1750262763, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这儿虽然不算什么闹市区，但是城市霓虹也不少”"}
{"time": 1750262774, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真麻烦\""}
{"time": 1750262789, "type": "recv", "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“被上传到社交媒体我们就可以和人生说再见啦”"}
