{"time": 1750339921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241217669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这……好吧，我可以帮你办理，但是会有看护人员的陪同，可以吧？”"}
{"time": 1750339997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421948646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头"}
{"time": 1750340101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468237759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"麻烦了\""}
{"time": 1750340153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "66793653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "那么这个小姐姐迅速地帮你办理了手续，并帮你叫了对应的陪护人员"}
{"time": 1750340225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694952951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "看上去沈群并没有被关到封闭区，陪护人员带你前往开放区的时候，你可以过一个聆听"}
{"time": 1750340252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430984467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra聆听"}
{"time": 1750340252, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1430984467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]进行技能[聆听:60]检定: 1D100=90 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1750340412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526494389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你们来到了探望区，护工将沈群叫来，然后站在一旁看着你们"}
{"time": 1750340442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820868269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "沈群突然被叫来，好奇又有点不耐烦地看着你"}
{"time": 1750340504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026606666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦，你好。\"无害地看着他"}
{"time": 1750340512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392783754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打量一下他现在的状态"}
{"time": 1750340545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101554566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "穿着病号服，不胖不瘦"}
{"time": 1750340568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621074164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你谁啊”他打量一下你，然后挖了一下耳屎"}
{"time": 1750340663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716231069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可欣姐让我来的。\""}
{"time": 1750340784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287302537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哈？那是谁啊？我不认识。”他满不在乎地说“护工小姐，这人是要干嘛啊，没事我就走了，我想上厕所”"}
{"time": 1750340812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331979205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他转身想走"}
{"time": 1750340816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072670584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我想了解一下五年前的事。\"瞪了他一眼"}
{"time": 1750340875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254705312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说起来)"}
{"time": 1750340881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120780136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "护工试图拦住他，被他挣脱了“不知道不知道，我都说了，我！要！去！厕！所！”"}
{"time": 1750340887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015505447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有什么印记或者徽章吗？)"}
{"time": 1750340898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929972876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我教你，你跟他去厕所）"}
{"time": 1750340898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979398328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "然后不停咋舌"}
{"time": 1750340932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575061010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "护工开始向你道歉“看来今天他情绪不是很稳定……要不……”"}
{"time": 1750340942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412583637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"不情愿地点点头"}
{"time": 1750340946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693254227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "可以过一个侦查"}
{"time": 1750340961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402444819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧，你就让他走吧。\""}
{"time": 1750340964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338479103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra侦查"}
{"time": 1750340964, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1338479103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]进行技能[侦查:60]检定: 1D100=41 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1750341001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851182098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你看出来护工似乎对沈群抱有恐惧"}
{"time": 1750341072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589662655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看一眼沈群，叹口气，\"你先走吧，让他也走吧。\""}
{"time": 1750341161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361072947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好的，需要问他的基础情况吗？既然要调查？”"}
{"time": 1750341168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965181887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不用的话，我就……”"}
{"time": 1750341191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1030087513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，\"他这个样子，不用了。\""}
{"time": 1750341221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641340348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "那么护工离开了"}
{"time": 1750341385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435519709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着他的动向"}
{"time": 1750341401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1381308355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他确实是进了厕所"}
{"time": 1750341505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272351392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想了想，在厕所旁边稍微等两分钟"}
{"time": 1750341563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274977157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你并没有等到他出来"}
{"time": 1750341598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685733947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有点不淑女了\""}
{"time": 1750341601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618987023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走进洗手间"}
{"time": 1750341614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325654779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "顺带一提，这里的厕所比较奇怪，既分男厕女厕，也有那种男女皆能进去的厕所单间"}
{"time": 1750341776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861640045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "走进去，看看里面有没有人"}
{"time": 1750341844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936602952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "有一间的门虚掩着，里面正是沈群"}
{"time": 1750341864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799734482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“来的真慢”他冷哼一声"}
{"time": 1750341873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309852117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，毕竟要甩掉尾巴。\""}
{"time": 1750341892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261936448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以呢？要把我救出去了？”"}
{"time": 1750341894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579826495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你给人的形象还真差，他那么怕你\""}
{"time": 1750341906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418264474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大家长是这么说的。\""}
{"time": 1750341925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745570372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"该带你出去了，不过这活只有三个人办，我是里面最弱的。\""}
{"time": 1750341951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124273400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嘿，我用法术让那些病人把身体部位割下来给我吃，他们怀疑我，但是又找不到我的把柄，当然会怕”"}
{"time": 1750341968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776587693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "说起自己做的恶行，他非常的高兴"}
{"time": 1750342003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763697751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"用的还真有些恶趣味，不过邓可欣也没什么好说的\""}
{"time": 1750342027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395413501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你有什么打算吗？\""}
{"time": 1750342037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058662289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那婆娘居然没死，不知道又在哪霍霍帅哥”"}
{"time": 1750342064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291116349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我怎么打算？我的病房可是24小时监控，只能看你们了”"}
{"time": 1750342095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922313817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“现在也只能在这里聊一小会，等会就得出去”"}
{"time": 1750342133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926106490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你不是会法术?\""}
{"time": 1750342230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116517099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"应该有办法吧。\"打个哈欠"}
{"time": 1750342238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296080362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“日复一日干扰那些病人给我提供吃食还是可以的，这种临时的难度这么大的行动，怎么会有啊”"}
{"time": 1750342264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318025205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“真要闹事出去了，也不过是被警察抓回来的份”"}
{"time": 1750342329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897080714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，反正只要把那位大人叫下来\""}
{"time": 1750342335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517222150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"抓回来也无所谓吧，你说呢\""}
{"time": 1750342438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78654030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？咱们要把祂召唤下来了吗？”"}
{"time": 1750342564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233166299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大家长是这么打算的。\""}
{"time": 1750342613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530739711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那么，杀出去？”他舔了舔嘴唇，兴奋起来"}
{"time": 1750342625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703789594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，感觉像是什么困兽犹斗，拼死一搏。\""}
{"time": 1750342687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074760240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，\"留下的线索越少越好，你在这里这么久，探出什么了吗？\""}
{"time": 1750342727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181169013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“探出来他们对我看的很紧，算线索吗？”"}
{"time": 1750342781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902568855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“虽然我房间被监控了，但是整个医院还是有不少的监控死角的”"}
{"time": 1750342856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966359024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看来你混的不如那边啊。\""}
{"time": 1750342866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586091724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了，那就先这样，具体的事就在这两天了\""}
{"time": 1750342881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57078959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（并非这两天"}
{"time": 1750342894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813342765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（事情顺利的话，是在19号举行仪式"}
{"time": 1750342932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699505459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(今天是?)"}
{"time": 1750342946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663104479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以说杀出去吗？”他习惯性地又掏耳屎"}
{"time": 1750342954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946527521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（5月19"}
