{"time": 1750343120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173037429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看看我们今晚商量的结果吧，直接杀出去还是动静太大了。\""}
{"time": 1750343147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362866177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"而且，19号才会召唤祂。\"打着哈欠"}
{"time": 1750343168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744572371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“唉，搞半天还没决定好，时间差不多了，我出去了”他大摇大摆地走了出去"}
