{"time": 1750343765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295852208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "虽然很奇怪为什么上午来过下午又来，但是还是通过了你的申请"}
{"time": 1750343836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1099784985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你又来到邓可心的病房，将东西交给了她"}
{"time": 1750343859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637468952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哎呦，行动力挺高嘛”此时病房只有她一人"}
{"time": 1750344841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879737126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] ）"}
