{"time": 1750345881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191110659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1637468952]“嗯，这些应该够了吧”"}
{"time": 1750345926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743421226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我乘这会想点办法，等门卫换班，我会制造骚乱，你自己想办法出去吧”"}
{"time": 1750346032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116730993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "她翻了一下袋子“应该够了，你忙去吧”"}
{"time": 1750346060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945253946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "就在这时，传来敲门声"}
{"time": 1750346074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982034554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯？”*和邓护法对一下眼神"}
{"time": 1750346166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180502703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“邓小姐，有人找你”"}
{"time": 1750346183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "384959071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我在啊）"}
{"time": 1750346210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961427724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要开门吗？猜得到是谁吗？”*做个口型"}
{"time": 1750346239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901755288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“进来吧”"}
{"time": 1750346246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "158499799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "开门的是你们见过的那个护工，跟着她的是一个近1米9的国字脸小伙"}
{"time": 1750346327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550532526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "小伙没有料到还有其他人在房间内，露出惊讶神色，然后盯着邓可心看了一会，似乎在想什么"}
{"time": 1750346395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152249810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他拿出笔记本写了些什么，然后问道“稍微问些问题，现在方便吧？”"}
{"time": 1750346395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296601225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这位总不会是……我未来的侄女婿吧”"}
{"time": 1750346405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713122448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，看来是我想多了”"}
{"time": 1750346406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792214521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这位是.......?”"}
{"time": 1750346428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153529877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“他是我亲戚”邓可心冷冷地回答道"}
{"time": 1750346494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451044202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有什么事？”"}
{"time": 1750346541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361203290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我想问问你，是否认识蔡志国这个人”他看向邓可心"}
{"time": 1750346566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730095169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那是谁？没有听过的名字”邓可心道"}
{"time": 1750346572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "31613476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（这是调查员吧）"}
