{"time": 1750606392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35577612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=163692489]那就往那边走"}
{"time": 1750606442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747492730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你走近片场，却被工作人员拦了下来，他对你说明这边在拍摄，请勿靠近"}
{"time": 1750606482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397524804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不一定要飞"}
{"time": 1750606495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357039109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（但是要是打起来也是帮手对吧（"}
{"time": 1750606593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998895287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"本小姐来这边观摩观摩，怎么了？不许?\""}
{"time": 1750606609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744534195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“......你谁啊”"}
{"time": 1750606757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805997289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我信用70，认不出来吗)"}
{"time": 1750606818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007042804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（信用高不一定小人物认识你啊"}
{"time": 1750606879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714684838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哦，你是那个啥啥集团的大小姐是吧”"}
{"time": 1750606901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674905874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“但是我们这边在拍摄，无关人员是不能进来的”"}
{"time": 1750606963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529481336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（如果你要认识的话，在精神病院你就被认出来了"}
{"time": 1750606978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160234342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你不能只有在想被认出来的时候被认出来（"}
{"time": 1750606983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932673592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还真是)"}
{"time": 1750607005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123235384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...这片子也有我们集团的投资，你还是让我过去吧。\""}
{"time": 1750607029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889570834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "翻个白眼，\"不行就给你们领导打电话，敢拦本小姐?谁给你的胆子\""}
{"time": 1750607080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393982849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“......我给领导打个电话”"}
{"time": 1750607084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544743115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来这几个警察怎么还不走”*皱眉“我整事的话，容易被认出来”"}
{"time": 1750607102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063293756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你去看看？”*看向[CQ:at,qq=2388921818]"}
{"time": 1750607113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737223662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=2388921818] 我大哥和你说话呢"}
{"time": 1750607156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693969562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1393982849]过了一会，员工回来和你说没听说你家有投资"}
{"time": 1750607166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082946547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你们俩面面相觑"}
{"time": 1750607185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809901077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，没什么所谓，现在投资不就行了。\"翻个白眼，\"没个眼力见吗？\""}
{"time": 1750607188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964512073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他在粥）"}
{"time": 1750607194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702663929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"本小姐也要拦?\""}
{"time": 1750607194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115987842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（我就知道"}
{"time": 1750607224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994520694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“规定就是规定，放你进来了我要丢饭碗的”"}
{"time": 1750607281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114858920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你之后去我公司当保安，给你开双倍工资。\"实在没耐心了，抬脚往里走"}
{"time": 1750607304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805498894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"本小姐一时兴致，不要烦我。\"不管他了"}
{"time": 1750607317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772673327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你是真的厉害"}
{"time": 1750607420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226718006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你想强行闯入，但是他叫了其他几个工作人员把你架了出去"}
{"time": 1750607427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932794923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你猜我为什么ban伊神的高信用卡"}
{"time": 1750607432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255655824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为不想见到这种东西）"}
{"time": 1750607448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037426573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（无所谓，我不会给他进去的"}
{"time": 1750607450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1190297559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(因为这是)"}
{"time": 1750607459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299152625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(恶阵营)"}
{"time": 1750607480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141318631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...再说一遍，别惹我。\"喘气"}
{"time": 1750607497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354278932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（感觉像在逗小孩"}
{"time": 1750607565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719135149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "几个工作人员就这么一声不吭看着你，他们虽然不敢把你怎么样，但是看上去你是无法闯进去了"}
{"time": 1750607589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550313638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1063293756]“哈哈，我不去。”"}
{"time": 1750607644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028979877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"把你们领导电话给我。\"耐住性子"}
{"time": 1750607688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247123346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他拨通了领导电话递给你"}
{"time": 1750607818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776469949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"喂?知道我是谁的话，这个片场的保安一直拦我，能处理吗？\""}
{"time": 1750607898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996690431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=550313638]“……搞不清楚的话，我也没办法”"}
{"time": 1750607900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680294156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“顾大小姐是吧？为什么一定要进片场看呢？能否给我一个理由？”"}
{"time": 1750607938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200004356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我对你们的剧有点兴趣，没了。\""}
{"time": 1750607968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53204076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好麻烦啊，理由很重要吗？还是说你不想拉顾氏的投资\""}
{"time": 1750608029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396275786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“但是现在还在拍摄中啊，拍摄的片场可是很无聊的，况且我们也没有闲暇照顾大小姐”"}
{"time": 1750608139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712367232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我管你这那的，我就是来逛逛。就这样\""}
{"time": 1750608236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985978106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*回去找邓可欣"}
{"time": 1750608251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254221347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“顾大小姐，您还是别为难我们了好吗？毕竟坏了顾家的声誉也不好”"}
{"time": 1750608261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427130022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（唉，好傻逼的伊神）"}
{"time": 1750608369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1741565758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1985978106]那么你又进去了，再次填申请时，前台以异样的眼光看着你，没有说话"}
{"time": 1750608388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723939224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么还要填表）"}
{"time": 1750608392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807731781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(为什么要拦着我)"}
{"time": 1750608414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579288335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（每次都要填申请啊）"}
{"time": 1750608421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361370118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（总不能随便走吧）"}
{"time": 1750608437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526491360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（和校外人士进学校一个道理）"}
