{"time": 1750608540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238170690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总之进去了，问问邓可欣“你之前说，你能想办法黑掉监控？”"}
{"time": 1750608552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326049292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "顾幼龄虽然强行进入无果，但是你注意到警戒线只是在街道上分割了开放区和摄影区，两侧的房子是连在一起的"}
{"time": 1750608583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909787557", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=238170690]“我把他们调教完以后，”"}
{"time": 1750608628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451681554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼..！\"翻个白眼，找个片场旁边的茶楼坐下"}
{"time": 1750608669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659141336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=238170690]“我把他们调教完以后，他们想找我折磨他们，所以会经常性地把监控关掉”"}
{"time": 1750608688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110080785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我有个想法，不知道可不可行，你来根据医院运作方法判断可行性”"}
{"time": 1750608708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096048128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "她妩媚的笑了笑，就像个蛇蝎美人"}
{"time": 1750608798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214966321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=451681554]你找到一家附近的茶楼，茶楼是二层建筑，一楼是大厅，二楼是包间"}
{"time": 1750608896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106976075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在这里一楼听一听拍摄有没有什么风言风语，没有就上二楼包厢坐下"}
{"time": 1750608897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771609024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你先乔装好，把监控关掉，然后在换班前后找个楼梯间，或者厕所躲起来。之后我会找前台，说你失踪了，这里是精神病院，在全面戒严前想必不会闹得太大，目光会集中在你的原病房，以及监控室，在他们反应过来前，你应该有机会混出去”"}
{"time": 1750608901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92141165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（那些B警察还没走呢）"}
