{"time": 1750609083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898410851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1771609024]“嗯……应该可行，过段时间他们会自己把监控关掉的，我等会自己乔装一下”"}
