{"time": 1750609869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398368993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。ra幸运"}
{"time": 1750609869, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1398368993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[月神夜]进行技能[幸运:50]检定: 1D100=42 成功，春风得意马蹄急，一日看尽长安花"}
{"time": 1750609971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465894969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“坏了？”"}
{"time": 1750610023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341886420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“啊，时不时会坏掉，蛮正常的嘛，哈哈，总之我们还是快点找人吧”"}
{"time": 1750610069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272709979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "然后他们便散开分头寻找，每个楼层寻找过去，幸好邓可欣没有躲在楼梯口，她顺利地绕过搜查的人群，跟你对视一眼便向外面走去"}
{"time": 1750610119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609926629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=442442369]你找到了一个临近的房子，这里正好有一个监控死角，但是你要放火的话也许动作得快"}
{"time": 1750610134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417333580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "毕竟是在路边，很容易被人发现"}
