{"time": 1750688755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999936581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（献祭的时候把祭司干掉就好了）"}
{"time": 1750688761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1253213170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（把祭司干掉就好了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1750688785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694966486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "手里捧着酒杯下台，挥挥手臂\"有记住本小姐吗？下次再见啦！\""}
{"time": 1750688808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1364316720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（假传圣旨把祭司干掉，倒逼黄王再给一次请神术）"}
{"time": 1750688810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761096465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=7A041B56E65857137896C38077833550.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQS8niuT_HMKq4qddJ_MfZFf6FhOBinXyD_CiiBhPiE4IeOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhB6ig_EjZ08oTo6iC30D9JuegJS9Q&amp;rkey=CAQSMAuq9sGwWBXaypdjqUh7KJUGKJ-x6xoVSGJBmT4D8uNlrUvWzg1lQY45fXB-79lQwA,file_size=12199]"}
{"time": 1750688899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687341144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总之，回去开车回来"}
{"time": 1750688997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706205430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "下台之后看看老板在哪"}
{"time": 1750689030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985459423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "老板又回到了调音台附近看演出"}
{"time": 1750689072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411285890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随意拿起两杯酒走过去，递一杯给他"}
{"time": 1750689079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039628681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"办酒吧开心吗？\""}
{"time": 1750689136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410001913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“还行吧，虽然赚的不算多，但是每天忙活来忙活去也挺乐呵的”"}
{"time": 1750689159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028160222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“还能像现在这样时不时办一下演出”"}
{"time": 1750689180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309216297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他浅尝一口"}
{"time": 1750689203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020177234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来音乐内容要不要留心一下）"}
{"time": 1750689267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271820409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"少来，今天不全是靠本小姐捧场。\"举起酒杯一口气喝一半"}
{"time": 1750689334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471010943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“也不是天天有像小姐这么豪迈的客人啊，平时招待一些常客，真赚不了多少钱”"}
{"time": 1750689483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268285112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（直接跟他说）"}
{"time": 1750689493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77114086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（“有人要你的命，很舍得出钱”）"}
{"time": 1750689519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007244067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只要能开心就好啦，老板。\"一饮而尽，\"啊，感觉又有点晕了。\""}
{"time": 1750689593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475770100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过呢...\"把杯子随意搁在一旁，欺身上前，小声，\"有人要你的命。\""}
{"time": 1750689678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395308307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“诶？”他一脸懵逼“这是……什么个说法”"}
{"time": 1750689793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764442301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们去后台说”他把你带到后台"}
{"time": 1750689808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1317379570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就是字面意思啦。\"扶着脑袋，\"听不懂吗？\""}
{"time": 1750689825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792109719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你得罪了怪人，那人出了很高价，要你的命\""}
{"time": 1750689946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079557235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那我要咋办啊，我总不能就这样跑路吧”"}
{"time": 1750690133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677224621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"无妨。\"头有点晕，\"你也可以先离开这座城市，躲一段时间。\""}
{"time": 1750690195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35025071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“啧，明天还有一天演出……”"}
{"time": 1750690237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181877147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那要我命的人知道我跑了，不会继续等我回来吗？也许我应该关掉这个店……”"}
{"time": 1750690308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058225346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，你要是求求本小姐，本小姐也不是不能帮你摆平这事。\"酒劲上来，有些干呕"}
{"time": 1750690369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539482148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“真的可以吗？”他很激动“不过我也没有什么钱，你应该也看不上我的钱……”"}
{"time": 1750690563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793245010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"出于个人兴趣，本小姐做事，一向不讲什么道路。\""}
{"time": 1750690588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307073307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"看一眼手机，回复肖，\"想吐了，先回家\""}
{"time": 1750690724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913868764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这样啊……”看着眼前这个老是不按常理行事的小姐，老板不知道该不该相信她“小姐您要是能保住我的性命，那我是不用逃跑了？”"}
{"time": 1750691025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724831509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"随便啦随便啦。\"出门，看看自己的车在哪"}
{"time": 1750691116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164533289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "张叔和车就在外面，他看着你的眼神简直是充满了担心和无奈"}
{"time": 1750691125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553142570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "(怎么把邓可欣忘了"}
{"time": 1750691197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600248671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不道啊)"}
{"time": 1750691219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173392721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...\"扶着车干呕，\"张...张叔...回家"}
{"time": 1750691254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319724657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我一会要回来的）"}
{"time": 1750691340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918489172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“小姐，这是你连续第二天来酒吧了，老爷知道了就真要控制你了”"}
{"time": 1750691397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1499159790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这时，你们的手机上收到邓可欣发来的消息“你们都哪去了”"}
{"time": 1750691454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496758576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“刚才我喝酒喝的正开心呢，结果看到那个老板怪怪的，我现在打探一下”"}
{"time": 1750691482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539234425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我回去拿车了”"}
{"time": 1750691487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482907836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事啦，可心姐，你要不跟我回家?\""}
{"time": 1750691519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1754041540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1918489172]\"唉，好烦啊。\"眼神迷离，意识涣散，\"不说就行了...\""}
{"time": 1750691529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217993565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“？那陨石呢，而且不是要抓老板嘛”"}
{"time": 1750691591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670245066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“陨石我已经拿下了。至于老板，想带走总得要车不是？”"}
{"time": 1750691605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400282126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好像拿到了，老板先别管了。\"艰难打字，尝试拉车门"}
{"time": 1750691653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361091975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "过个体质吧那就"}
{"time": 1750691679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425613635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我先在这等小哥开车回来吧那就”"}
{"time": 1750691908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308700045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。ra体质"}
{"time": 1750691908, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1308700045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[顾幼龄]进行技能[体质:70]检定: 1D100=73 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1750691927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420046030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "那么你吐了出来"}
{"time": 1750692029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761426215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那就扶着车门对着路边一顿吐"}
{"time": 1750692104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790095724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“唉……”驾驶位传来叹息"}
{"time": 1750692186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141404480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "(那你要回去了对吧"}
{"time": 1750692342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338726332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我应该回去了)"}
{"time": 1750692539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927979063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "等你缓得差不多了，张叔就开车带你回家了"}
{"time": 1750692610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938197780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "回去倒头就睡"}
{"time": 1750692639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202931284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*开车回去"}
{"time": 1750692822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "108568758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "大概9点40这样，你回到了livehouse"}
{"time": 1750692904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458605460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*进去左顾右盼“嗯？姓顾的丫头走了？”"}
{"time": 1750692969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574641582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不懂她，喝不了还要喝，直接给我们减员了”"}
{"time": 1750693005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1021775038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“接下来就是抓老板了，等演出中场换乐队的时候行动吧””"}
{"time": 1750693042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151756505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“中场吗？不等散场了？”"}
{"time": 1750693120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403082707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“酒吧肯定是开到深夜啊，难道我们待到深夜吗”"}
{"time": 1750693142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013372019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“反正怎么都会闹出动静，我还想睡美容觉呢”"}
{"time": 1750693158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308958476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也行，不过其实比起酒吧老板，我更讨厌我的老板”"}
{"time": 1750693184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403242103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哪个老板？小哥你是干什么工作的？”"}
{"time": 1750693219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451579805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说的是我们的祭司大人”"}
{"time": 1750693276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491416226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“他啊，搞艺术的都这样吧，神神经经的，我不喜欢”"}
{"time": 1750693332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319319753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且是不是太蠢了，对付个酒吧老板都要靠我们来”"}
{"time": 1750693403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572701329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这教都是他开起来的，他不干活也正常吧”"}
{"time": 1750693416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391019594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“虽然我也觉得他是个废柴”"}
{"time": 1750693460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149870713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那这边的酒吧老板呢？”"}
{"time": 1750693487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789926911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“挺有意思的，至少不给人添麻烦”"}
{"time": 1750693624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129641440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以你的意思是？”"}
{"time": 1750693676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "735983675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“瞒天过海呗，反正祭品也不需要非得是他”"}
{"time": 1750693733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539687238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“......那可是他指名道姓要的人哦”"}
{"time": 1750693741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427994287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不是跟他有仇吗”"}
{"time": 1750693798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230336931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“给一具焦尸就好了，他能验出来算他厉害”"}
{"time": 1750693826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808363806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你家祭品给焦尸？"}
{"time": 1750693841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560241351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（什么时候能用死人当祭品了"}
{"time": 1750693929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1457249712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就说他被我们追进了酒窖，把酒打翻了触电起火”"}
{"time": 1750693941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601480207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“然后随便换个谁的尸体吧”"}
{"time": 1750694024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123403217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这会我到家了吗)"}
{"time": 1750694031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724438765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没有的话还是可以给我发短信先)"}
{"time": 1750694032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651294299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（到了吧"}
{"time": 1750694050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431787566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是这样的，我也不知道你干了什么）"}
{"time": 1750694067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664013268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之，我们先去吓吓他”"}
{"time": 1750694124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432756713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（我在想的是活祭的事"}
{"time": 1750694146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627368359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（召唤拜亚基的祭品是要让祂下来吃掉的"}
{"time": 1750694160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90210429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不可抗力和我又没关系.jpg）"}
{"time": 1750694190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673615862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "回到家，发个短信，\"找他的事我已经说了，有事明天再聊吧。困了。\""}
{"time": 1750694225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573011904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“祭品我记得是要活的吧......尸体好像不太行”"}
{"time": 1750694253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184708883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "接着她拿起手机一看“......这是什么意思”"}
{"time": 1750694303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110966358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“活祭满大街都是，又不是非得是他”"}
{"time": 1750694366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663373485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“做这么麻烦的事，就为了放他一马？咱们教居然出了这么单纯的家伙”"}
{"time": 1750694388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622212403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1184708883]“你说了什么？”回信"}
{"time": 1750694436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792925510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好烦啊，你。我就是说有人要杀他啦，之类的。”断断续续回信"}
{"time": 1750694443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523287595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“单纯吗，哈哈”"}
{"time": 1750694516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524218570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "回一个无语的表情包，然后对肖越和说“好啦，原来我们的顾大小姐已经自作主张搞砸了一切了”"}
{"time": 1750694531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976231256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“怕是他现在已经跑掉了吧”"}
{"time": 1750694575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409588810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听起来不需要我们苦恼怎么交代了”"}
{"time": 1750694614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871921064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，也就是说，现在这儿没人管账了？”*往吧台区"}
{"time": 1750694623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119688309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你们早就串通好了？”"}
{"time": 1750694647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53956409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果一起吐槽上司也算串通的话？”"}
{"time": 1750694652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440857508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "吧台区老板不在，有一个大概是雇来帮忙的酒保"}
{"time": 1750694700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655898287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“今天是不是有个大小姐说全场消费她来买单的来着？”"}
{"time": 1750694716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223328161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“确实是这样”酒保回答"}
{"time": 1750694756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351840263", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那麻烦帮我来两杯前调裂的吧，有点渴了”"}
{"time": 1750694764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975425992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那麻烦帮我来两杯前调烈的吧，有点渴了”"}
{"time": 1750694867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125071738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他给你调了一杯龙舌兰和一杯长岛冰茶"}
{"time": 1750694888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002565280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "邓可欣则点了一杯鸡尾酒小酌"}
{"time": 1750694906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536434720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来你们老板呢？”"}
{"time": 1750694936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8022241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“老板好像去后台了”"}
{"time": 1750695092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875578513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧”*一口小半杯，给邓可欣发消息“要不先给他带回去，等要献祭那天，我们给那祭司踹了”"}
{"time": 1750695145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018851986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好大的胆子，你为什么觉得我会帮你们呢？这么相信我”"}
{"time": 1750695183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463022461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“可能是因为我们是同好”"}
{"time": 1750695187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252687858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=524218570]回复一个咬人的表情包，然后息屏把手机扔到一边休息"}
{"time": 1750695204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875596774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果我猜错了，那就是我识人不准”"}
{"time": 1750695229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166461057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（同好在哪）"}
{"time": 1750695249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186038766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你也喜欢玩激烈的游戏？”"}
{"time": 1750695479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445384440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只是都讨厌上司，敬自由”*碰杯"}
{"time": 1750695579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608425987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“有点意思”她也碰杯"}
