{"time": 1751281021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878454654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "喝酒的时光很愉快，然而你还是得决定一下怎么和祭司交差"}
{"time": 1751281081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092956574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要不我们提前逼宫，就不用想怎么交差了”借着酒劲发表暴论"}
{"time": 1751281137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018577476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“......你想怎么做”邓可心摇晃手中的酒杯"}
{"time": 1751281186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981271786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“他很能打吗？”"}
{"time": 1751281194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161963689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看着一般吧”"}
{"time": 1751281204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "562439795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且现在拜亚基在我们手上”"}
{"time": 1751281251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127802128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“直接回去把他杀了？那谁来当新的祭司呢”"}
{"time": 1751281348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341181978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“他只有脑子里的请神术比较值钱吧？”"}
{"time": 1751281468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173020885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那确实是”"}
{"time": 1751281511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442477058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说起来，他是怎么当上祭司的？我呆的时间短，在他之前还有前任吗？”"}
{"time": 1751281548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214070363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "邓可心轻笑“他就是第一任祭司啊，他亲手创办的黄王教”"}
{"time": 1751281641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47358151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听起来，黄王老人家也不是非他不可对不对”*又喝一口"}
{"time": 1751281718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295721870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“把他解决掉以后，谁来当领袖呢”"}
