{"time": 1751288453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067909653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "在拜亚基的助力下，对方显然不是对手，不一会儿就全部被你们控制住"}
{"time": 1751288600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333642643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“都说了，为什么不肯好好去死？”抬起脚踩在一个教徒脸上，露出病态的笑，“有带刀吗？”"}
{"time": 1751288630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282337900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“厨师的职业素养”*拿出随身携带的剔骨刀"}
{"time": 1751288676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140541907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接过刀，“让我想想，你吃人喜欢先片哪里？”"}
{"time": 1751288677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568845907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我还挺好奇的，你怎么看出来的？”*蹲在祭司面前，笑盈盈地看着他"}
{"time": 1751288685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77602034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，忘了你被封嘴了”"}
{"time": 1751288707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894089958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“呜呜！呜呜呜！”"}
{"time": 1751288753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70209120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我么……小腿吧，肥瘦适中，锻炼充分”"}
{"time": 1751288791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069410007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“祭司只是有所怀疑罢了，留了一手，谁知道你们居然真的叛变了！”"}
{"time": 1751288812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924105954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "没有被踩着的那个教徒大叫"}
{"time": 1751288823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331861987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你正好先思考一会答案，连召唤黄衣之王的咒文也一并回忆回忆吧”*手捧着他的脑袋，掰向另一边的凌迟现场"}
{"time": 1751288901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933283389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着眉看着开口的这个，对着这个开口的信徒不满地撇过头，一脚把踩着的人踢开，拿起刀搭在他的嘴巴上，“你好吵。”用力沿着嘴巴边沿划开，“嘴巴张得更大一些怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1751288916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1222127931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（裂口男）"}
{"time": 1751288953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191674097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“唔啊啊啊，错乐错乐”他不住地求饶"}
{"time": 1751289023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832456537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“选择很重要。”忍不住大笑，“划在别人身上，好像比自己畅快十倍。”笑得眼泪都要下来了，继续用力"}
{"time": 1751289074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894274837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“啊啊啊啊！”惨叫声回荡在仓库中"}
{"time": 1751289199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62023449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（好消息）"}
{"time": 1751289207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225272884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（我又挤出来30石）"}
{"time": 1751289229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459622505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "舔舔嘴唇，收回刀一刀扎在他的手臂上，“啊，好了好了，这种活还是要专业人士做。”转过头看着被踢翻的教徒，笑容满面“你呢？还要做一次选择吗？”"}
{"time": 1751289269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79089879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了好了，一会把警察喊来就不好了。而且过度紧张会导致乳酸堆积……”"}
{"time": 1751289282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069625455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他吓得不敢回答你"}
{"time": 1751289362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204218028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？这可是难得的玩耍时间。”略有些遗憾，踩几脚这个不敢回话的教徒，“刚刚不还是很嚣张吗？”"}
{"time": 1751289398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11290089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他不停地摇头，大概是在表示再也不敢了"}
{"time": 1751289400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687920350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不太雅观，但是令人身心舒畅”"}
{"time": 1751289455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472781049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看向祭司，“您呢？祭司大人。”"}
{"time": 1751289537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410101158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在想一件事，如果一直对他用刀"}
{"time": 1751289538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224344023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*掏出另一把小刀，扎在他眼前“您这金口玉舌，今天过后还在不在，可是您自己说了算呐”"}
{"time": 1751289546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343021909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*随后把胶带撕开"}
{"time": 1751289549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508183142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（是不是会让他吃惩罚骰）"}
{"time": 1751289558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464490655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（什么意思"}
{"time": 1751289559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895234170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（和我的法术意志对抗的时候）"}
{"time": 1751289567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1268111670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（对吧"}
{"time": 1751289578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646028441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你要用什么）"}
{"time": 1751289585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222150886", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那就拦住肖的动作，“别急，我有更好的办法”"}
{"time": 1751289612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757433011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(原来你给我的是人定)"}
{"time": 1751289619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401085466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是控制)"}
