{"time": 1752066756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883976947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*找到救护车值班室医生，向他出示实习证明"}
{"time": 1752066809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664407513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？这年头连救护车出车都安排实习啊”"}
{"time": 1752066812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488838351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我们学校实习要求进行一次救护车室值班，你看能不能今天就进行。”"}
{"time": 1752066850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793424905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“对啊，学校说什么有必要增加各种情况的实习经验，增大学生就业范围。”"}
{"time": 1752066864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1052980976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我也觉得很麻烦，但是还是毕业必要的。”"}
{"time": 1752066903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104725033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好现实的话术）"}
{"time": 1752066938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474409753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“唉，那你就来跟车吧，到时候我帮你开实习证明”"}
{"time": 1752066957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445629767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好的，多谢了。”"}
{"time": 1752066962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "707137753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你也不用实际上干什么，说不定今天都不用出车”"}
{"time": 1752067000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770326086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那最好了，出车应该很累吧。”"}
{"time": 1752067067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "881103031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“还好，只是对不同的病人要进行不同的急救处理，有时候还要在车上进行抢救”"}
{"time": 1752067087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123614448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以什么都得会”"}
{"time": 1752067133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974926805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这次你就好好看着吧，毕竟是实习”"}
{"time": 1752067148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890693404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“一般都是几个人出车啊？”"}
