{"time": 1752334081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393609274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这下该怎么去找他。\"扶着额头，耸耸肩，\"只能去他公司咯\""}
{"time": 1752334092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396608274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我估计就是回公司了，我已经记住刚才的车型和牌号了，我们直接去公司找他们吧。”"}
{"time": 1752334241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868753271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……感觉宗祠也没什么看头”"}
{"time": 1752334267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066461225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过我猜他会去高尔夫球场？不过那里资本气息有些太浓了”"}
