{"time": 1752335902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267436765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那他就拦你啊，你又不说你是谁为什么要让你进）"}
{"time": 1752335914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956034395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(结果发现好像不是我自己的，后面就只能另外说了)"}
{"time": 1752335915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493828194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“……”员工们互相看两眼，派出了其中一个去通知里面的老板们，“那就请小姐稍等片刻，我们通知一下里面的老板”"}
{"time": 1752336055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1273331098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你可以亮出你的身份啊）"}
