{"time": 1752336114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1342481925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（上次拦你是因为那些员工本来就被控制了，不管你也正常吧）"}
{"time": 1752336123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564260127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(出门在外说自己是谁谁的女儿)"}
