{"time": 1752336168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450659750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你要么车个女强人都好啊）"}
{"time": 1752336195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464953593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你车大小姐不就是只能搬家长吗"}
{"time": 1752336197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272043345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你都车70信用千金大小姐这种傻逼角色了"}
{"time": 1752336221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642730946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉)"}
{"time": 1752336230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834514166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像你是对的)"}
{"time": 1752336249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080474626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"快去快回。\""}
{"time": 1752336289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850220332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“能否告诉我们小姐的名讳？”"}
{"time": 1752336406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003903070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"顾氏的千金，可以了吗？\""}
{"time": 1752336458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "605240877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（还真是，他喜欢大小姐，想成为有钱大小姐）"}
{"time": 1752336469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988923139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=43B2A56BF06247340A244FB99DE06CBD.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQvju6fkgO_qY-NR3nEcmmAGWNj1RjNYCD_CiiB-feF2reOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCDVeryGIqbSXorXyqxb-68egLx0g&amp;rkey=CAESMCQpHJbBE9Cq56heU_JSV6oy17O5Oh-PdzbSpNQ8BcU3tZh-jUa0PxOj35csvsNh_g,file_size=12365]"}
{"time": 1752336559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125812376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "过了一会，员工回来领着你们进去"}
{"time": 1752336603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111986863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你真的要带资入组吗？”等喽啰走后，这么问顾“虽然可能一时能摆平他们，但是这种人为了吃点更好的应该不是很会挑手段”"}
{"time": 1752336713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698661986", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是可以谈谈，谈谈而已。\"重复一边，\"而且，我们在暗处。\""}
{"time": 1752336751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872924802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是可以谈谈，谈谈而已。\"重复一遍，\"毕竟，我是第一次入场嘛。\""}
{"time": 1752336774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160522009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=DD7F922A34507EEAFB93249D07E6B19D.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSyvQx6bZEDn6bTghi54uH6yFXopBjItAsg_woop6Dwltu3jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ3AvTB1WPg1W9n6L5AI4YiHoC--U&amp;rkey=CAESMCQpHJbBE9Cq56heU_JSV6oy17O5Oh-PdzbSpNQ8BcU3tZh-jUa0PxOj35csvsNh_g,file_size=186952]有8个人在沙坑里面，同时还有一人在视野开阔的位置（示意图位置 7）沙坑中正在举行四人二球赛，既二人对抗二人，每一方各打一个球的比赛。每队各有两名队员，一名球童（携带球杆等用具），剩下两人分别是裁判和观察员。在这些人里面只有裁判和观察员两人身上携带有通讯设备，负责与裁判和记分员沟通。记分员在入口处计分，同时还有一名裁判在场上视野开阔的位置（示意图位置7）等待。\n你们到达沙坑的时候，沙坑里面的几个人正在聊天，同时围在了一个人的边上，这个人就是邢森，他正在准备击打深陷沙坑的球，因为击打难度较大，他尝试了几次都没能够将球击飞，于是便转过身和周围人说笑。"}
{"time": 1752336807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963499728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "这时他们也注意到了你们，向你们走过来"}
{"time": 1752336841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863946871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "邢森主动上前“顾家的大小姐，今日有何贵干？”"}
{"time": 1752336846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478705021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好长一段，叽里咕噜在说什么)"}
{"time": 1752336849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243226864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=B4D25D65BCD0FCEB93E2667320BB442F.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQh3YqJHyFCmsizgm6bA-Rp_IpXehjbigEg_woo7q-1u9u3jgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ_f5FSaz8zYDmdtOqT5tDC3oCLgk&amp;rkey=CAESMCQpHJbBE9Cq56heU_JSV6oy17O5Oh-PdzbSpNQ8BcU3tZh-jUa0PxOj35csvsNh_g,file_size=17755]"}
{"time": 1752336857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240772842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（不用在意）"}
{"time": 1752336979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848136573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"听闻邢总在王家村有一笔不错的生意，我想来了解了解。不吝登门，冒昧之处有多见谅\""}
{"time": 1752337059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123919677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哪里哪里，小小生意能入了顾家的眼，我也是倍感荣幸啊”"}
{"time": 1752337087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504442399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“也就是说，顾家对这片地皮也有想法？”"}
{"time": 1752337109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339781705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"略有一些\"摆摆手，\"不过具体要看邢总的意思。\""}
{"time": 1752337144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814100740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那么，顾家想达成怎样的合作？”"}
{"time": 1752337222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "773547500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（尽量把他引开，话说这个人是目标吗）"}
{"time": 1752337242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181853458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是)"}
{"time": 1752337276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21141936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"开门见山一些吧，这块地皮邢总打算做什么开发。\""}
{"time": 1752337324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407440947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“打造成商业街”"}
{"time": 1752337567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179078250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...\"走进一步，压低声音，\"对那条街我们本身没有什么兴趣。\""}
{"time": 1752337591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028994602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？”"}
{"time": 1752337593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397247469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是，邢总赔偿的手段，可是让人耳目一新，这方面有没有交易的余地呢？\""}
{"time": 1752337612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130317774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“什么意思？”"}
{"time": 1752337649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037881321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"邢总觉得，那些村民会安心接受这笔拆迁款吗？\"打个响指，\"还是自信如此\""}
{"time": 1752337728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035510216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我觉得他们会接受的”邢森报以微笑"}
{"time": 1752337797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506018027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我想交易的是这里的门道。\"同样微笑"}
{"time": 1752337878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160161587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“顾小姐说笑了，咱们做生意的依赖的门道不就是真诚吗”"}
{"time": 1752338018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1493820496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摊摊手，\"我是带着真诚来。\""}
{"time": 1752338081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133897655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“但是我也只是和他们进行交涉罢了”"}
{"time": 1752338106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394479202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*找一找高尔夫球场的厕所位置"}
{"time": 1752338121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486881800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不行就用点金钱的手段，这不是很正常吗”"}
{"time": 1752338157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833268848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（准备去厕所伏击一下）"}
{"time": 1752338168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60615340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过我听说他们好像不太乐意，毕竟宗祠就在那来着”"}
{"time": 1752338216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106187258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=394479202]厕所在大门附近，离沙坑比较远"}
{"time": 1752338268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518405401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"群情激奋啊是不是，刚刚的石头砸到我头上了。\""}
{"time": 1752338320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738338435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“只是嫌弃钱少罢了，他们自己也知道那一片地是肯定留不住的”"}
{"time": 1752338445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283629342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1050565807", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果邢总确实能以够低的成本拿下所有钉子户的话……我们集团到确实有投资的打算”"}
